            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE 3 - MULTI MODE\n\nIn this example we feed the Text Render node a collection of strings.\nWe've set the  Text Render node to output seperate instances.\nIn this mode the node will render out each string as a separate texture.\nThis allows for creative uses of text at the expense of performance.\n"
