          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TEXT RENDER\n\nThe Text Render node takes a string type or a collection of strings and renders it to a Texture2Drgba type using a given size, font and orientation. There are additional options to add an outline or glow to your text.\n\nNote that this node has a lot of hidden parameters by default that might be worth exploring."
          }
        },
